{"id":"0079cad93c58c949","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness.md","title":"NW小电路欺骗的重构条件","display":"lem-nw-pseudorandomness — NW小电路欺骗的重构条件","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness","aliases":["28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness"],"display":"lem-nw-pseudorandomness — NW小电路欺骗的重构条件","depends_on":["[[28-df-nw-generator]]","[[28-df-nw-design]]","[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]","[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 20.15, explicit reconstruction form","source_printed_pages":"411–412","source_pdf_pages":"437–438","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-nw-pseudorandomness — NW小电路欺骗的重构条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a21d838aabbea854\" href=\"?note=a21d838aabbea854\" title=\"28-df-nw-generator\">28-df-nw-generator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" href=\"?note=7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" title=\"28-df-nw-design\">28-df-nw-design</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6058569a5f2311c9\" href=\"?note=6058569a5f2311c9\" title=\"28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit\">28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 20.15, explicit reconstruction form"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"411–412"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"437–438"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell&gt;n&gt;d\">\\(\\ell&gt;n&gt;d\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\epsilon\\le1/2\">\\(0&lt;\\epsilon\\le1/2\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}\">\\(\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma\">\\(f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma\\)</span>。设计和生成器见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" href=\"?note=7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" title=\"28-df-nw-design\">28-df-nw-design</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a21d838aabbea854\" href=\"?note=a21d838aabbea854\" title=\"28-df-nw-generator\">28-df-nw-generator</a>；测试类和欺骗谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\coloneqq s+n+4m(d+1)2^d+4.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\coloneqq s+n+4m(d+1)2^d+4.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(T)\\;\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}[\\operatorname{out}_B(x)_1=f(x)]&lt;\\tfrac12+\\tfrac\\epsilon m\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Fool}_m(\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}(U_\\ell);s,\\epsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(T)\\;\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}[\\operatorname{out}_B(x)_1=f(x)]&lt;\\tfrac12+\\tfrac\\epsilon m\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Fool}_m(\\operatorname{NW}_{\\mathcal I,f}(U_\\ell);s,\\epsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部证明：若结论失败，混合引理给出位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 和总节点数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+3\">\\(s+3\\)</span> 的预测器，其成功率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2+\\epsilon/m\">\\(1/2+\\epsilon/m\\)</span>。将均匀种子拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\">\\(I_i\\)</span> 内外两组独立坐标，固定外部坐标使该成功率不降低。\n每个先前输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_j}(z))\">\\(f(\\operatorname{res}_{I_j}(z))\\)</span> 此时只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\cap I_j\">\\(I_i\\cap I_j\\)</span> 中至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 位。任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\le d\">\\(t\\le d\\)</span> 位布尔函数可用完整真值表的 DNF 构造：至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 个共享 NOT，加至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^t\">\\(2^t\\)</span> 个项的 AND 树及 OR 树；连同常量边界，其非输入门数小于等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4(d+1)2^d\">\\(4(d+1)2^d\\)</span>。\n将这些至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m-1\">\\(m-1\\)</span> 个小电路接入预测器，并加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个自由输入节点，得到计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的电路 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，总节点数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+n+4m(d+1)2^d+4=T\">\\(s+n+4m(d+1)2^d+4=T\\)</span>，成功率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2+\\epsilon/m\">\\(1/2+\\epsilon/m\\)</span>，与前提的严格上界矛盾。\n这是 Lemma 20.15 的参数化充分条件，额外显式计入输入节点及常量门；它不照抄书中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{avg}}/10\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{avg}}/10\\)</span> 的常数。允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=0\">\\(d=0\\)</span>，此时先前限制函数为常量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nw-generator","status":"resolved","id":"a21d838aabbea854","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nw-generator]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nw-design","status":"resolved","id":"7d58f8e24dbfba2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nw-design]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","status":"resolved","id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit","status":"resolved","id":"6058569a5f2311c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nw-design","status":"resolved","id":"7d58f8e24dbfba2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","loca